    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Toppers developed as an informal residential community during the 1950s and 1960s due to the recreational appeal of the lake.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/toppers_oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Construction of Fort Gibson Lake submerged substantial fertile farmland, shifting the local economy from agriculture to tourism and leisure.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
